    "scope": "Valve component comparison",
    "supports": "Later-reference AV valves have branching chordae. Aortic and pulmonary reference cusps form arterial-facing pockets with curved attachment lines and surrounding sinus walls; one aortic cusp retains three removable tissue layers.",
